    boxes: A `Tensor` of type `float32`. 3-D with shape `[batch,
      num_bounding_boxes, 4]` containing bounding boxes.
    colors: A `Tensor` of type `float32`. 2-D. A list of RGBA colors to cycle
      through for the boxes.
